     Recovery method Consumer expectations
-    =============== ========================================
+    =============== =========================================
     none            optional telemetry collection
     rebind          unbind + bind driver
     bus-reset       unbind + bus reset/re-enumeration + bind
     vendor-specific vendor specific recovery method
